## Enumeration Strategy (Windows, many open ports)

**Must look at:**
- SMB — look for open shares
- LDAP — can I get info without credentials?

**If those fail:**
- Kerberos — brute force usernames, then AS-REP-roast any found
- DNS — zone transfer possible? Brute force subdomains?
- RPC — anonymous access possible?

**Note for creds:**
- WinRM — creds for a user in Remote Management Users group = shell
